# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored, never commit it) and fill in
# a real Anthropic API key for local `wrangler dev` testing.
#
# This is a dev-only convenience — the deployed Worker gets its key via
# `wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` instead (human-user checkpoint,
# see docs/cloudflare-backend-plan.md).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-dev-key-here
